INFO  2026-04-26T06:12:18 +0ms service=decision-log taskID=tsk_dc8652563001nhFRBleW2cEv2N key=naming_convention value=## All API mocked constraint
```text
CONSTRAINT: All API calls are mocked — no real network requests allowed.

This means:
1. No fetch() calls to external URLs (except mock data loads from local files)
2. No XMLHttpRequest usage
3. No WebSocket connections
4. No EventSource / SSE connections
5. No third-party SDK remote calls (e.g., Baidu analytics, tracking pixels)
6. All data sources return static JSON or function return values
7. All user interactions trigger mock functions (console.log or toast)
8. No real navigation to baidu.com or any external URL
9. The src/mock/ directory documents each mock data source and its mapping
   to the original API it replaces
